				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&bThermal Cultivation"
			x: -7.0d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"&aThermal Innovation&r is the tool module - the &fFlux Drill&r, &fFlux Saw&r, &fInjector&r and &fPotion Infuser&r."
				""
				"&e&lThey take Redstone Flux and augments&r, so one drill covers speed, area and silk-touch-or-fortune depending on what you slot in."
				""
				"&7Cheap, early, and they cover most of what you would otherwise wait for a Meka-Tool to do.&r"
			]
			icon: "thermal:flux_drill"
			id: "072740F789D579E2"
			rewards: [{
				id: "7925ADE665F26A31"
