		{
			description: [
				"&aThermal Integration&r is the cross-mod module - it wires the Thermal machines into the rest of the pack rather than adding machines of its own."
				""
				"&7Nothing to build here. It is the reason your Thermal machines accept and emit things they otherwise would not.&r"
				""
				"&8With this installed the pack now runs the full seven-module Thermal series."
			]
